pan><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.08125em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">ψ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">⟩</span></span></span></span>","key":"LyiVGfgs57"},{"type":"text","value":" 相当于在旧版本的输出上\"测试\"新补丁的影响，二阶修正则考虑了补丁与原有代码之间的\"交叉效应\"。","position":{"start":{"line":15,"column":1},"end":{"line":15,"column":1}},"key":"UiwteXOMX1"}],"key":"BRfMCLZwnG"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":17,"column":1},"end":{"line":17,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"这个类比可以进一步延伸。自旋的发现相当于发现系统中有一个此前未被文档化的隐藏变量——就像你在审计一个遗留代码库时发现了一个未记录的全局状态变量，它一直在暗中影响程序的输出。自旋-轨道耦合则相当于这个隐藏变量与已知变量之间存在的耦合关系。而外磁场中的塞曼效应，就是将系统暴露在一个外部环境参数之下，观察其响应如何依赖于内部状态——这本质上是一种\"压力测试\"或\"环境扫描\"。通过改变外磁场的强度，观察能级分裂的模式，物理学家可以反推原子内部角动量耦合的细节，就像工程师通过改变输入参数来探测黑盒系统的内部结构。","position":{"start":{"line":17,"column":1},"end":{"line":17,"column":1}},"key":"Hl59mlt4jR"}],"key":"t73o10I5dp"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":19,"column":1},"end":{"line":19,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"答案在于电子拥有一个此前未知的隐藏自由度——自旋。本章首先通过施特恩-格拉赫实验引入自旋的概念，讨论自旋作为电子内禀角动量的物理意义及其与经典旋转的根本区别。自旋 ","position":{"start":{"line":19,"column":1},"end":{"line":19,"column":1}},"key":"eyeidwARnk"},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"s = 1/2","position":{"start":{"line":19,"column":1},"end":{"line":19,"column":1}},"html":"<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s = 1/2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/2</span></span></span></span>","key":"ZRfCDhagRL"},{"type":"text","value":" 是自然界中最简单的量子系统，它只有两个本征态(向上和向下)，在数学上可以用二维复向量和泡利矩阵完整描述——这使它成为量子计算中量子比特(qubit)的天然原型。然后我们将分析自旋如何与轨道角动量耦合，导致能级的精细分裂，以及外部磁场如何引起能级的进一步分裂(塞曼效应)。朗德 ","position":{"start":{"line":19,"column":1},"end":{"line":19,"column":1}},"key":"bHAH8iYAam"},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"g","position":{"start":{"line":19,"column":1},"end":{"line":19,"column":1}},"html":"<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span c